# =============================================================================
# Only the bulky DATA artifacts are excluded. READMEs, figures (*.png) and config
# stamps under outputs/ ARE committed so experiment docs render on GitHub, and the
# experiment visual aids under experiments/*/assets/ are committed too.
# =============================================================================

# --- Bulky data bundles (regenerated on demand) ---
*.npz
*.npy
*.nc
*.pkl
*.grib
*.grb

# --- Per-iteration evolution frames & animations ---
# The full per-iteration frame set and the GIFs stay on disk but are NOT uploaded:
# only the first/last frame of each sequence is committed (force-added in the commit),
# alongside growth_curves.png. This keeps the repo light (frames+GIFs are ~220 MB).
*.gif
**/plots/evolution/*/*.png
**.png

# --- Logs ---
*.log
nohup.out

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- OS / editor ---
.DS_Store
*.swp

# NOTE: outputs/ is intentionally NOT ignored wholesale. Each run keeps its
# README.md, config_used.yaml and plots/*.png; only the heavy bundles above are
# excluded. Do not add `outputs/` or `*.png` here.

# =============================================================================
# Outputs & Experiment Artifacts
# =============================================================================
# 忽略大量自動生成的參數掃描與個別實驗資料夾 (包含裡面的 README, yaml, png)
outputs/**/sweep*/
outputs/**/tseries*/
outputs/**/snapshot*/
outputs/**/ring_*/

# (可選) 忽略個別實驗目錄下單獨的 plot 資料夾
outputs/**/plots/

# 但強制保留 (不忽略) 跨實驗的總結性圖表
##!outputs/**/figures/*.png